                                PRESENTS

                   S!XInfo v1.0 coded by WHiZ/LOGiC !

    PROFESSIONAL TOOLS FOR PROFESSIONAL SYSOPS - GET THE REAL QUALITY !


WHAT'S THE USE OF THIS TOOL ?
-----------------------------

        It displays an important message (e.g. change of SYSPW) to every
        user during logon sequence.

        The user is forced to watch it a certain time.

        It looks very funny, so check it out !


WHY SHOULD I USE IT ?
---------------------

        If you love speed and beautiful outputs this is the tool
        you have been waiting for ! Install it, and see for yourself.

HOW TO INSTALL THIS TOOL :
--------------------------

        Copy these files :

        BBS/Doors/S!XInfo/S!XInfo      --> DOORS:S!XInfo/S!XInfo
        BBS/Doors/S!XInfo/S!XInfo.Txt  --> DOORS:S!XInfo/S!XInfo.Txt
        BBS/Doors/S!XInfo/S!XInfo.Doc  --> DOORS:S!XInfo/S!XInfo.Doc
        Libs/AEDoor.library            --> LIBS:


        Append BBS/Commands/BBS.CMD to your BBS:Commands/BBS.CMD !


        The S!XInfo.Txt is the text to be displayed... change it to
        your needs !

        Call it during logon sequence from any bull using MCI-Command :

        ~CC_S!XINFO


        That's all...


LAST WORDS :
------------

        It has been tested for a long time from S!X developers, so you can be
        sure this tool is 100% bug-free !

        S!X running with official S!X tools NEVER crashes, like other
        BBS software does, hehe...

        See ya soon mates...
                                                                 WHiZ/LOGiC !
